---
const lastUpdated = 'September 3, 2026';
const appName = 'TinyFingers';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Terms and conditions for using TinyFingers, a fullscreen keyboard smash toy for babies and toddlers." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#07101f" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <title>Terms &amp; Conditions | TinyFingers</title>
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --background: #07101f;
        --panel: #101d31;
        --panel-strong: #1c3451;
        --ink: #f6f9ff;
        --muted: #c3d0e3;
        --accent: #65d8ff;
        --accent-2: #ffd84d;
      }
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html {
        color-scheme: dark;
        font-family: ui-rounded, "SF Pro Rounded", "Arial Rounded MT Bold", system-ui, sans-serif;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 10%, rgb(101 216 255 / 0.14) 0%, transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 20%, rgb(159 122 234 / 0.12) 0%, transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 55% 95%, rgb(255 216 77 / 0.1) 0%, transparent 55%),
          var(--background);
        background-attachment: fixed;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        color: var(--accent);
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      }
      a:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 3px;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }

      .page {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3rem) 1rem 4rem;
      }

      .back-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.16);
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 750;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
      }
      .back-link:hover {
        background: var(--panel-strong);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .back-link::before {
        content: "‹";
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .panel {
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 3.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
      }

      .kicker {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 2.75rem);
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .last-updated {
        margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 2.25rem 0 0.6rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 3.5vw, 1.35rem);
        font-weight: 850;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      h2:first-of-type {
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      p strong {
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      ul,
      ol {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.4rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }
      li::marker {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .footer-note {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .back-link {
          transition: none;
        }
        .back-link:hover {
          transform: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to {appName}</a>

      <article class="panel">
        <p class="kicker">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-03">{lastUpdated}</time></p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
        <p>
          By downloading, accessing, or using {appName} ("the app"), you agree to be bound by
          these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to any part of these terms, please do
          not use the app. If you are a parent or guardian, you agree to these terms on behalf of
          yourself and the child using the app.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Description of the service</h2>
        <p>
          {appName} is a fullscreen keyboard, touch, and mouse toy designed for babies and
          toddlers. The app plays sounds and visuals in response to keys, taps, and clicks. The
          app is intended for entertainment only and is not a learning, educational, or medical
          product.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Use by children</h2>
        <p>
          {appName} is designed for use by young children under the supervision of a parent,
          guardian, or responsible adult. By allowing a child to use the app, you acknowledge
          that you are responsible for their use of the app and for their safety while doing so.
        </p>

        <h2>4. No data collection</h2>
        <p>
          The app runs locally on your device. It does not collect, store, or transmit any
          personal information, and it does not include analytics, advertising, or third-party
          tracking. Nothing you or your child does in the app is sent to us or anyone else.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          All content in the app — including the software, design, graphics, sounds, and the
          {appName} name — is owned by or licensed to us and is protected by copyright and other
          intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute, sell, or reverse
          engineer any part of the app, except as permitted by law.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the app in any way that violates applicable law or regulation;</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, damage, or interfere with the app or its underlying systems;</li>
          <li>Copy or redistribute the app or its content for commercial purposes.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The app is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether
          express or implied, including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
          particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the app will be
          uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of data, arising
          out of or in connection with your use of the app, even if we have been advised of the
          possibility of such damages.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. The latest version will
          always be available on this page, and the "Last updated" date above will reflect the
          most recent change. Your continued use of the app after changes take effect means you
          accept the revised terms.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please
          <a href="mailto:hello@surajmh.dev">contact us</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="footer-note">
          These terms were written for {appName}, a toy for little hands and big smiles.
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>